{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"帖撒罗尼迦后书","commonName":"帖撒罗尼迦后书","title":"帖撒罗尼迦后书","order":53,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"1800df49591aa774d708b30bc0e628f29c32484cb1c76d295bea9b990c150ca9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2TH/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":47},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["请求代祷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄姊妹，最后我还要请你们为我们祷告，好使主的道像在你们那里一样迅速传开、受到尊崇，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["并使我们能避开那些邪恶的人，因为不是人人都有信心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["主是信实的，祂必使你们刚强，保护你们脱离那恶者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我们靠着主深信你们正遵行我们的吩咐，而且以后还会继续遵行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["愿主引导你们的心领悟上帝的爱和基督的坚忍。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["不可游手好闲"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["弟兄姊妹，现在我们奉主耶稣基督的名吩咐你们，要远离那些游手好闲、不遵守我们教导的信徒。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你们自己知道应该怎样效法我们，因为我们在你们那里的时候，并没有懒懒散散，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["也没有白吃谁的饭，而是昼夜辛勤工作，免得成为你们任何人的负担。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这并不是因为我们没有权利接受供应，而是要给你们树立学习的榜样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我们在你们那里的时候，曾吩咐过你们：不肯工作的人没有资格吃饭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我们听说在你们当中有些人游手好闲，无所事事，专管闲事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我们奉主耶稣基督的名吩咐并劝诫这些人要安分守己，自食其力。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["弟兄姊妹，你们要坚持行善，不要灰心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["如果有人不听从这信上的教导，要注意提防他，不要和他来往，好使他羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["只是不可把他当作仇人，要像对待弟兄姊妹一样劝诫他。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["问候"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["愿平安之主随时随地亲自赐你们平安！愿主与你们同在！"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["我保罗在这里亲笔问候你们，这是我的笔迹，我所有的信都以此为记号。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["愿我们主耶稣基督的恩典与你们众人同在！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2TH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2TH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}